{"sourceUrl":"https://ce.lzu.edu.cn/index.php?m=content&c=index&a=show&catid=14&id=2485","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:47.988342+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://ce.lzu.edu.cn/index.php?m=content&c=index&a=show&catid=14&id=2485","html":"<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3>关于举办“生态学院2025年优秀大学生暑期夏令营”活动的通知</h3>\n<h3></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t发布日期：<span>2025-06-16 09:00</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t阅读量：\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span>\n\n</span>次\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>为促进全国各高校优秀大学生之间的交流，零距离接触和全方位了解兰州大学及生态学院，选拔有培养潜质的优秀大学生继续深造，在兰州大学研究生院的支持下，生态学院将举办</font><font>“</font><font>生态学院</font><font>2025</font><font>年优秀大学生暑期夏令营</font><font>”</font><font>活动。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><font>一、兰州大学及生态学院简介</font></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>兰州大学是教育部直属的全国重点综合性大学，是国家</font><font>“985</font><font>工程</font><font>”</font><font>、</font><font>“211</font><font>工程</font><font>”</font><font>重点建设高校。</font><font>2017</font><font>年，兰州大学入选</font><font>“</font><font>双一流</font><font>”</font><font>建设高校名单（</font><font>A</font><font>类）。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>生态学院的历史可追溯至</font><font>“</font><font>国立兰州大学</font><font>”1946</font><font>年成立的</font><font>“</font><font>植物学系</font><font>”</font><font>和</font><font>“</font><font>动物学系</font><font>”</font><font>。</font><font>1995</font><font>年国家批准设立</font><font>“</font><font>干旱农业生态国家重点实验室</font><font>”</font><font>，</font><font>2018</font><font>年学校成立</font><font>“</font><font>生态学创新研究院</font><font>”</font><font>，</font><font>2022</font><font>年学校以生命科学学院生态学与环境科学系和生态学创新研究院为班底组建成立全新的生态学院。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>生态学院现有生态学一级学科博士学位授权点，林业硕士专业学位授权点。生态学于</font>1986<font>年获批博士学位授予权，</font><font>1987</font><font>年获评国家重点学科，</font><font>2017</font><font>年第四轮学科评估获评</font><font>“A”</font><font>，并于同年入选国家</font><font>“</font><font>双一流</font><font>”</font><font>学科建设行列，</font><font>2021</font><font>年生态学一流学科总体建设成效为</font><font>“</font><font>优秀</font><font>”</font><font>（第一档），</font><font>2022</font><font>年软科中国最好学科排名中，兰州大学生态学学科位列前</font><font>2%</font><font>，</font><font>2023</font><font>年软科中国最好学科排名中，兰州大学生态学学科位列第一。</font></span></span><span><span>2025<font>年，兰州大学环境与生态学学科（</font><font>Environment/Ecology</font><font>）成功进入全球前</font><font>1‰</font><font>行列。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>学院现有在职专任教师</font>83<font>人，其中国家杰出青年科学基金获得者</font><font>5</font><font>人，</font><font>“</font><font>长江学者奖励计划</font><font>”</font><font>特聘教授</font><font>3</font><font>人，</font><font>“</font><font>国家高层次人才特殊支持计划</font><font>”</font><font>领军人才</font><font>2</font><font>人，百千万人才工程国家级人选</font><font>2</font><font>人，</font><font>“</font><font>国家高层次人才特殊支持计划</font><font>”</font><font>青年拔尖人才</font><font>3</font><font>人，</font><font>“</font><font>长江学者奖励计划</font><font>”</font><font>青年学者</font><font>2</font><font>人，国家自然科学基金优秀青年科学基金获得者</font><font>8</font><font>人，师资队伍实力雄厚。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>学院科研平台建设突出，拥有</font><font>“</font><font>草种创新与草地农业生态系统全国重点实验室</font><font>”</font><font>（与草地农业科技学院合建）和</font><font>“</font><font>甘肃甘南草原生态系统国家野外科学观测研究站</font><font>”</font><font>等国家级科研平台，并拥有室内综合实验测试分析中心、大型计算模拟中心、</font><font>6</font><font>个省级野外科学观测研究台站和</font><font>“</font><font>中巴联合共建野外科学观测研究台站</font><font>”</font><font>等科技平台，有力保障了创新型人才的培养。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><font>二、活动安排</font></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.<font>举办时间：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2025<font>年</font><font>7</font><font>月</font><font>1</font></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>-1</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span><font>日</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><font>活动内容：</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>本次夏令营</font></span></span><span><span><font>活动</font></span></span><span><span><font>采用</font> “<font>线上</font><font>+</font><font>线下</font><font>”</font><font>相结合的模式举办，旨在为更多优秀学子提供参与机会。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><font>线下参与（限额</font>40<font>人）：</font></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>学院将优先组织线下营员的选拔，计划招收约</font>40<font>名优秀本科生。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>入选的线下营员将有机会亲临兰州大学校园，深度体验学院科研环境、实验室设施，与导师及学长学姐进行面对面深入交流，并参加实地考察等特色活动（具体安排以最终通知为准）。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>申请线下参与的同学，需在报名时明确选择，并确保能按时抵校参加。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><font>线上参与（人数不限）：</font></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>若您在线下营员选拔中未能入围，或虽入围但因故无法参加线下活动，但仍希望了解我院的学科特色、师资力量及研究生培养情况，欢迎通过学院指定的线上平台参与本次夏令营。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>线上参与人数不设上限。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>线上营员可通过</font></span></span><span><span><font>指定平台</font></span></span><span><span><font>参与夏令营的主要学术活动，包括学院介绍、前沿学术讲座、部分师生互动环节等。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>特别说明：</font> <font>学院将根据申请材料严格选拔线下营员。未入选线下营员的优秀申请人，如仍有参与意愿，将自动获得线上参与资格（无需再次申请），具体线上平台及参与方式将在营员名单确定后另行通知。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><font>线下活动安排：</font></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7<font>月</font><font>1</font></span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span><font>日下午：营员报到</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7<font>月</font><font>12</font><font>日上午：生态学院暑期夏令营开营仪式、学院及学科方向介绍</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span> 7<font>月</font><font>12</font><font>日下午：专家讲座</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7<font>月</font><font>13</font><font>日：参观活动及结营仪式</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><font>三、申请条件</font></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.<font>具有良好的政治素质和思想道德素养，政治立场坚定，德、智、体、美、劳全面发展，遵纪守法，身心健康；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2.“<font>双一流</font><font>”</font><font>院校、所学专业学科排名在第四轮学科评估中被评为</font><font>“B”</font><font>以上院校、或其它省部属重点院校本科三年级在校生（</font><font>2025</font><font>届本科毕业生）；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3.<font>学习成绩优秀，申请学员前两年半学习成绩排名在全年级前</font><font>20%</font><font>；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>4.<font>对所报专业的学术研究有浓厚兴趣，计划从事学术研究工作；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>5.<font>英语水平良好。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><font>四、申请材料</font></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.<font>网上报名</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>即日起至</font>2025<font>年</font><font>6</font><font>月</font><font>25</font><font>日（</font><font>24:00</font><font>）前，登录兰州大学硕士研究生推免生系统（</font><font>http://yjszs.lzu.edu.cn/lzuyjsytms/</font><font>）进行网上报名。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2.<font>提交材料</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>（</font>1<font>）《兰州大学生态学院优秀学生暑期夏令营申请表》（见附件</font><font>1</font><font>）；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>（</font>2<font>）两封专家推荐书（须副教授以上专家推荐，亲笔签名并留联系方式，见附件</font><font>2</font><font>）；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>（</font>3<font>）大学期间成绩单原件（教务部门盖章）及前两年半学习成绩排名证明原件（教务部门或院系盖章）；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>（</font>4<font>）英语四六级成绩单复印件，或其他英语考试成绩证明复印件；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>（</font>5<font>）学生证复印件；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>（</font>6<font>）其他证明材料（如已发表论文的复印件、奖状复印件、各类证书复印件等）；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>（</font>7<font>）个人陈述（侧重陈述已开展的实验、科研经历及未来学习和研究计划等）；</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>请于</font>6<font>月</font><font>25</font><font>日（</font><font>24:00</font><font>）前将以上材料按照</font><font>1-7</font><font>的顺序编号并扫描成</font><font>PDF</font><font>文件发送至</font><font>stym@lzu.edu.cn</font><font>（邮件主题统一命名为</font><font>“</font><font>暑期夏令营</font><font>-</font><font>姓名</font><font>-</font><font>所在院校</font><font>”</font><font>格式），逾期不再接收申请。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3.<font>审核录取</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>根据材料提交情况，学院将对照申请条件严格审核，确定暑期夏令营招生名单，并邮件或电话通知入选学员，同时在学院网站上公布入选名单，未入选者不影响参与推免生预接收申请资格。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>申请人务必保证提交的各项材料真实准确，如有不实情况，一经发现将直接取消参营、参评优秀营员的资格，并保留追诉的权利。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><font>五、其他事项</font></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>1.<font>学院将为营员提供暑期夏令营期间的食宿、人身保险费</font><font>(</font><font>保险期为报到后至闭营</font><font>)</font><font>和往返硬座火车票</font><font>/</font><font>汽车票</font><font>/</font><font>高铁二等座车票（往返交通费超过</font><font>800</font><font>元部分自理）。住宿提供双人标间，原则上要求双人入住。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2.<font>请自行提前预订往返车票，学院不提供订票服务。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>3.<font>参加暑期夏令营活动营员，需履行请假、告知等方式取得所在学校和父母知晓并同意，同时注意出行安全。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>4.<font>营员报到后需全程参加暑期夏令营各项活动，并严格遵守兰州大学相关规章制度。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>5.<font>学院简介和更多导师简介欢迎大家登陆学院网站查看：</font></span></span><a href=\"http://ce.lzu.edu.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><u><span><span><span><span>http://ce.lzu.edu.cn/</span></span></span></span></u></a><span><span><font>。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>6.<font>营员可提前与意向导师沟通。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><b><span><span><span><font>六、联系方式</font></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>通讯地址：甘肃省兰州市天水南路</font>222<font>号兰州大学生态学院岫云楼</font><font>227</font><font>室，邮编</font><font>730000</font><font>。</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>电子信箱：</font>stym@lzu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>联系电话：</font>0931-8912836</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>联系人：赵老师</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>                                                                                                                 <font>生态学院</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><font>2025</font><font>年</font><font>6</font><font>月</font><font>1</font><font>6</font></span></span><span><span><font>日</font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://ce.lzu.edu.cn/uploadfile/2025/0618/20250618102717167.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件1:专家推荐信.doc</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://ce.lzu.edu.cn/uploadfile/2025/0618/20250618102717287.doc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">附件2 兰州大学生态学院优秀学生暑期夏令营申请表.doc</a><br/>\r\n </p> <br/><br/>\n</div>\n<div>\n<span>上一篇：<a href=\"https://ce.lzu.edu.cn/index.php?m=content&amp;c=index&amp;a=show&amp;catid=14&amp;id=2484\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">关于生态学院2025年本科生转专业考核结果的公示</a></span>\n<span>下一篇：<a href=\"https://ce.lzu.edu.cn/index.php?m=content&amp;c=index&amp;a=show&amp;catid=14&amp;id=2490\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">关于紧急救助兰州大学余煌煌同学的倡议书</a></span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"24926b6dc8a57a798842fd22f0c97b5496196f44a9d1a91970d117cd2aaddefa","textLength":2729,"sourceSha256":"d3e92d182e3dd395ceef9c5aac48034af1fa00833be4a16d7ce76dbec1e36b14","selector":"article-like:col_news_con","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-e6cc1c55a936a9badd87","title":"2025年兰州大学生态学院“生态学院2025年优秀大学生暑期夏令营”活动的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:47.988342+00:00"}
